Nucleus $p{=}0.9$ & 2 & 0.688 & 0.582 & 0.538 & 0.259 \\
Nucleus $p{=}0.95$, $T{=}1.0$ & 2 & 0.696 & 0.589 & 0.543 & 0.267 \\
$T{=}1.2$ & \textbf{3} & 0.723 & 0.648 & 0.574 & 0.312 \\
